  "formula": "ground v2: cover tiled at tile_size_m and at tile_size_m*phi, averaged, stretched 1+bias along the lodging azimuth and rotated to it; soil tiled at its tile_size_m, gained to its albedo_target when given; seeded blobs (an ellipse and three satellites) stamped to the bare and green shares, feathered 0.3 m (bare) and 0.5 m (green along the azimuth, counted outside bare); strewn masks clamp(2 m - c), c the cover luminance high-passed at STRAW_M, blended with LOBE_M value noise and stretched to 0-1: the bare mask's feather (noise 0.5) and the gaps between straws (a flat m of sqrt(gap_share / 2), noise GAP_LOBES 0), soil under both; albedo = cover with the straw gain for albedo_target, strips tinted to the green tint, soil under bare and gaps, then a global gain against clipping; normal composited the same with the cover normals rotated by the azimuth; mask R 0, G AO, B 0, A 1 - roughness; detail albedo = the detail set's diffuse as grey at its size with a linear mean of 0.5; 8-bit sRGB albedos",
